# Build output paths and the size each may reach before the `builds` tool
# deletes it whole for the next build to refill (cargo mostly from sccache).
# `builds new` links each path in a side worktree to
# /Volumes/Builds/agent-instructions/<checkout>/<path>, which also puts the
# worktree on `builds status` and the dashboard.
#
# scripts/builds/target is the builds tool's cargo target. The main checkout's
# held 4.2G of incremental debug builds on 2026-11-15; a side worktree builds
# without incremental output, so its cap is about twice that.
#
# path                    cap
scripts/builds/target     10G
